{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">粉嶺有私家車撞壆，司機昏迷送院證實死亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指在昨晚十時許，涉事七人私家車沿百和路向上水方面行駛，至蓬瀛仙館對開，撞向路中石壆後停下。53歲男司機昏迷，送院搶救後不治，警方在車內檢獲一個，懷疑作吸食危險藥物的工具，正調查他致命原因。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T00:59:41.593478+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}